%% UMIS target deployment + CI/CD — see 15_Deployment_Architecture.md
flowchart LR
    subgraph CI[CI/CD Pipeline]
        PR[PR] --> Lint[lint + typecheck]
        Lint --> Test[unit + integration + e2e]
        Test --> Build[next build + docker image]
        Build --> Scan[dependency + security scan]
        Scan --> Deploy{deploy}
    end
    Deploy -->|staging| Stg[Staging env]
    Deploy -->|prod, gated| Prod[Production env]
    subgraph Runtime[Runtime - containerized]
        App[UMIS Next.js container]
        Worker[Background worker<br/>queue: reminders/PDF/metrics]
    end
    Stg --> App
    Prod --> App
    App --> Mongo[(MongoDB + backups)]
    Worker --> Mongo
    App --> FB[(Firebase Storage<br/>+ audited Security Rules)]
    App --> Resend[Resend]
    App --> Obs[Observability<br/>logs · metrics · traces · error tracking]
    Worker --> Obs
    Mig[Migration framework<br/>versioned, tracked] --> Mongo
